build/
# everything here is regenerated by tools/make_bulk.py ...
src_generated/*
# ... except the hand-fix records, which are the only place those decisions live.
# Ignoring them was losing every recorded fix on a fresh clone, which is exactly what
# they exist to prevent (see README).
!src_generated/bulk_patches.csv
!src_generated/type_overrides.csv
!src_generated/auto_decls.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
